  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.58,
      585.07,
      555.07,
      675.22
    ],
    "text": "The \u2018Deep Depression\u2019 over the Bay of Bengal, located to the northeast of Sri Lanka, was centered approximately 620 km from Trincomalee as of 11.30 a.m. today (16 November). It is very likely to continue to move away from Sri Lanka and intensify into a \u2018Cyclonic Storm\u2019 by the evening of today over the southern and adjoining west-central Bay of Bengal, and further intensify into a \u2018Severe Cyclonic Storm\u2019 over the west-central Bay of Bengal by November 17.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599999785423279,
      5.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.58,
      679.0,
      554.98,
      717.34
    ],
    "text": "Several spells of showers will occur in the Western, Sabaragamuwa and North-western provinces and in the Kandy, Nuwara-Eliya, Galle and Matara districts.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.58,
      721.0,
      555.0,
      759.46
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers may occur at a few places in the Uva province and in Ampara district after 2.00 p.m.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.58,
      762.61,
      520.51,
      807.82
    ],
    "text": "Mainly dry weather will prevail over the other areas of the island. Misty conditions may prevail in most parts of the island during the early hours of the morning.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.9600000381469727,
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.58,
      811.5,
      513.98,
      948.24
    ],
    "text": "The general public is kindly requested to take adequate precautions to minimize damage caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.0,
      11.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
